  directions:
  - leftSpeaker: Surfer
    rightSpeaker: Big Bad CEO
    isLeftSpeaking: 0
    isRightSpeaking: 1
    leftSpeakerIdx: 0
    rightSpeakerIdx: 1
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: "You\u2019re still here. Didn\u2019t I tell all you water hippies to
      skip town?"
  - leftSpeaker: Surfer
    rightSpeaker: Big Bad CEO
    isLeftSpeaking: 1
    isRightSpeaking: 0
    leftSpeakerIdx: 0
    rightSpeakerIdx: 1
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: "I\u2019m not goin\u2019 anywhere jack! I\u2019m not gonna let you
      turn Big Wave Beach into a Shopping Mall! Dig?"
  - leftSpeaker: Surfer
    rightSpeaker: Big Bad CEO
    isLeftSpeaking: 0
    isRightSpeaking: 1
    leftSpeakerIdx: 0
    rightSpeakerIdx: 1
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: Just how are you gonna stop me, coral muncher?
  - leftSpeaker: Surfer
    rightSpeaker: Big Bad CEO
    isLeftSpeaking: 1
    isRightSpeaking: 0
    leftSpeakerIdx: 0
    rightSpeakerIdx: 1
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: "I\u2019m gonna surf, and keep surfing, and never stop surfing. You
      got it? These waves are in my blood, man. You\u2019re nothin\u2019."
  - leftSpeaker: Surfer
    rightSpeaker: Big Bad CEO
    isLeftSpeaking: 1
    isRightSpeaking: 0
    leftSpeakerIdx: 0
    rightSpeakerIdx: 1
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: "Also, according to California Constitution, Article 4, Section 19,
      if I\u2019m out there surfing, you can\u2019t do any construction. "
  - leftSpeaker: Surfer
    rightSpeaker: Big Bad CEO
    isLeftSpeaking: 0
    isRightSpeaking: 1
    leftSpeakerIdx: 0
    rightSpeakerIdx: 1
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: "You\u2019re smart for a west coaster, but if you think that\u2019ll
      actually stop me you might as well-"
  - leftSpeaker: Surfer
    rightSpeaker: Big Bad CEO
    isLeftSpeaking: 1
    isRightSpeaking: 0
    leftSpeakerIdx: 0
    rightSpeakerIdx: 1
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: Yeah like, whatever man.
  - leftSpeaker: Surfer
    rightSpeaker: Big Bad CEO
    isLeftSpeaking: 1
    isRightSpeaking: 0
    leftSpeakerIdx: 0
    rightSpeakerIdx: 1
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: Cowabunga!
